{"id":"vod_md_6111","vodId":"6111","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"骚动时节的少女们啊","name_cn":"骚动时节的少女们啊","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231019-1/056c4419638b4e1616b0b3c16a1df99d.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生于某所高中的文艺部内。很轻易就陷入妄想之中的小野寺和纱（河野日和 配音）、总是不经意之间做出惊人发言的菅原新菜（安济知佳 配音）、恋爱经历为零，异常单纯的文学少女须藤百百子（麻仓桃 配音）、想要创作属于自己的小说的本乡一叶（黑泽朋世 配音）和性格非常古板，对性的话题避之而不及的社长曾根崎莉香（上坂堇 配音），隶属于文艺部的是这五名性格迥异的部员。一天，大家正在讨论“死前想要做的事情”这一话题，平日里默默无闻的新菜突然暴言“想要体会一下性爱”，这句突如其来的发言让整个文艺部都陷入了混乱之中，少女们虽然对这句话的反映各异，但她们的心都被次撩动了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-19 07:20:54","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/OWfpQSut/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/1d8QMhE8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/9fSd2Mpx/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/XkqWrfZ0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/Ejjq6kWP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/7d5Y4YC2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/7Jvpd1Ka/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/5YXbk8hZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/ALA9RFtv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/2iYdwRQ8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/rk0MbxDO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231018/2PwsMQqj/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:31:22.446Z"}